---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import MarketingChrome from "../../components/MarketingChrome.astro";

const phoneDisplay = "(501) 413-3386";
const tel = "tel:+15014133386";
const sms = "sms:+15014133386";
---

<Base
  title='Houston Mobile Mechanic Website, Free Demo | NV Labs'
  description='Houston mobile mechanics: I build a free demo site for you remotely, with your service area and one-tap calling. Call or text (501) 413-3386.'
  image="/og.png"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <MarketingChrome>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Houston mobile mechanics</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Websites for Houston mobile mechanics, built remotely and built right</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm Saad, based in Las Vegas. I build your free demo by phone and text. You look at it on
        your phone between jobs, then decide.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text me</a>
        <a class="btn btn-text" href="/aaron-the-mechanic/">See a Houston mechanic demo</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="honest-title">
      <h2 id="honest-title">Straight up: I'm not in Houston</h2>
      <p>
        I build websites for local businesses all over, and I do it by phone and text. You don't
        need to meet me in person. You send me a few details, I build your demo, and you look at it
        on your phone between jobs.
      </p>
      <p>I just want to be honest about that up front.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="area-title">
      <h2 id="area-title">Houston is huge, so your service area matters</h2>
      <p>
        Houston sprawls in every direction. A customer in Katy and a customer in Pasadena are a long
        drive apart, and you don't want to burn half a day on traffic.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your site will spell out exactly where you go. Maybe it's the west side out to Katy and
        Cypress. Maybe it's south toward Pearland, Sugar Land, and Missouri City. Maybe it's inside
        the Loop, The Heights, and up to Spring. You tell me, and I'll write it so customers know
        right away if you cover them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="jobs-title">
      <h2 id="jobs-title">Jobs you handle where the car sits</h2>
      <p>
        Houston heat is rough on cars. Dead batteries, AC problems, and overheating are everyday
        calls. I'll list the work you do on site in plain words so people can tell if you're the
        right call:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Batteries, starters, and alternators</li>
        <li>AC checks and recharges (if you do them)</li>
        <li>Brakes and rotors</li>
        <li>Diagnostics and check engine lights</li>
        <li>Fleet or work truck service, if you offer it</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="near-title">
      <h2 id="near-title">Built for "mobile mechanic near me"</h2>
      <p>
        When a car breaks down on the Beltway or in an H-E-B parking lot, people search on their
        phone and call fast. Your site will load quick, show your service area right away, and have
        a big one-tap call button.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'll also make sure your site and your Google Business Profile match, with the same name,
        phone, and service area. That helps Google connect the dots. I can't promise rankings, but
        you'll be set up correctly.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <h2 id="how-title">How we work together from a distance</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>You call or text me with your business name and what you do.</li>
        <li>You send a few photos of your truck, your work, or yourself if you're comfortable.</li>
        <li>I build a free demo and text you the link.</li>
        <li>You look it over and tell me what to change.</li>
        <li>If you like it, I put it live. If not, you're free to walk away.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <div>
          <h3>How can you build my site if you're not in Houston?</h3>
          <p>
            Everything I need comes over text and phone: your services, your area, your photos. Most
            of my work happens on a computer anyway, so being in Las Vegas doesn't slow things down.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Will the site mention the Houston areas I cover?</h3>
          <p>
            Yes. I'll list the actual neighborhoods and suburbs you serve, written naturally so it
            reads well for customers and makes sense to Google.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>What if I mostly work on fleets or commercial trucks?</h3>
          <p>
            I'll build the site around that. We can focus the pages on businesses instead of
            everyday drivers, or cover both.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <h2 id="cta-title">Let's build your Houston demo</h2>
      <p>A quick text is all it takes to get started.</p>
      <a class="phone-big" href={tel}>{phoneDisplay}</a>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href={tel}>Call</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href={sms}>Text</a>
      </div>
      <a class="back-home" href="/">Back to NV Labs home</a>
    </section>
  </MarketingChrome>
</Base>
